  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/8abad4a2-1814-4083-865c-1553ed8fb08e.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 294px;\" /></p><p>Height of the liquid column&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>volume</mtext><mtext>base&#160;area</mtext></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Now capacitance of the upper part can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p>Capacitance for the lower part can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/480c454a-e050-4af7-8174-dcdc0ad4f916.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 336px;\" /></p><p>Both part of the capacitor can be considered as connected in parallel,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pF</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
